1
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:33,000
"Bittersweet Love"

2
00:01:33,500 --> 00:01:37,000
(Episode 9)

3
00:02:03,416 --> 00:02:04,416
Fanfan.

4
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:06,125
It's been two months.

5
00:02:34,791 --> 00:02:35,791
Fanfan.

6
00:02:36,875 --> 00:02:38,041
I'd like some porridge.

7
00:02:39,541 --> 00:02:40,583
Pork porridge?

8
00:02:42,666 --> 00:02:43,958
No scallions.

9
00:02:45,458 --> 00:02:46,750
But without scallions,

10
00:02:47,375 --> 00:02:48,625
it'll taste gamey.

11
00:02:52,916 --> 00:02:55,333
Then just put in more shredded ginger.

12
00:02:57,500 --> 00:02:59,666
I'll toss in some diced celery.

13
00:03:42,208 --> 00:03:44,250
The left and right burners differ in power.

14
00:03:44,333 --> 00:03:45,666
The right burner's for soup.

15
00:03:47,166 --> 00:03:48,566
The stockpot goes on the right too.

16
00:03:50,375 --> 00:03:51,375
How come this place

17
00:03:51,916 --> 00:03:53,958
looks exactly like the house in Yunjing?

18
00:04:18,125 --> 00:04:19,125
Bro.

19
00:04:19,250 --> 00:04:20,892
You don't have to step
into the kitchen anymore.

20
00:04:20,916 --> 00:04:22,000
Just leave it to me.

21
00:04:25,875 --> 00:04:26,666
What's wrong?
Nothing.

22
00:04:27,541 --> 00:04:28,541
It's nothing.

23
00:04:33,333 --> 00:04:34,375
How can you be so clumsy?

24
00:04:35,208 --> 00:04:36,375
Back in Yunjing,

25
00:04:36,750 --> 00:04:38,208
you also kept knocking into this cabinet.

26
00:04:40,286 --> 00:04:41,286
Yeah.

27
00:04:43,041 --> 00:04:44,041
This place

28
00:04:45,041 --> 00:04:46,750
is just like Yunjing.

29
00:04:54,166 --> 00:04:56,833
I got Lin Ziyang to do the renovation.

30
00:04:57,125 --> 00:04:58,165
Same with him.

31
00:04:58,166 --> 00:04:59,208
He's so careless.

32
00:05:00,875 --> 00:05:01,875
When the time comes,

33
00:05:02,208 --> 00:05:04,041
get your brother to dine with Lin Ziyang.

34
00:05:04,083 --> 00:05:05,083
I'll make him apologize.

35
00:05:10,333 --> 00:05:11,333
Bro.

36
00:05:11,875 --> 00:05:13,458
Where did you get these videotapes?

37
00:05:15,333 --> 00:05:16,791
Look how clear it is.

38
00:05:17,375 --> 00:05:18,575
Does it look like a videotape?

39
00:05:23,500 --> 00:05:26,166
Far sharper than theater tapes.

40
00:05:28,125 --> 00:05:29,765
Still watching "The Bride with White Hair?"

41
00:05:33,875 --> 00:05:36,625
How many times have you seen this film?

42
00:05:38,375 --> 00:05:39,375
I've lost count.

43
00:05:40,333 --> 00:05:41,333
Probably

44
00:05:41,541 --> 00:05:42,708
dozens of times.

45
00:05:44,458 --> 00:05:46,166
Just what's this movie about?

46
00:05:47,416 --> 00:05:49,250
Zhuo Yihang, a disciple
of an orthodox sect,

47
00:05:49,666 --> 00:05:52,041
falls for the enchantress Lian Nichang.

48
00:05:53,958 --> 00:05:56,041
"Can you turn my white hair black again?"

49
00:05:56,666 --> 00:05:58,375
She means

50
00:06:00,041 --> 00:06:01,208
spilled water

51
00:06:02,083 --> 00:06:03,583
can't be scooped back.

52
00:06:10,500 --> 00:06:13,083
Lian Nichang never
stopped loving Zhuo Yihang.

53
00:06:14,833 --> 00:06:16,291
No grace when she came,

54
00:06:17,500 --> 00:06:18,875
yet with grace she leaves.

55
00:06:31,875 --> 00:06:33,625
If you love watching discs so much,

56
00:06:34,250 --> 00:06:35,541
you could move in.

57
00:06:57,541 --> 00:06:59,291
As for Xiaoping's work,

58
00:06:59,500 --> 00:07:00,875
I'll leave it to you, Mr. Lu.

59
00:07:02,333 --> 00:07:03,653
Mr. Lin, you're being too formal.

60
00:07:04,083 --> 00:07:06,447
I'm honored you thought
to come to me for help.

61
00:07:06,875 --> 00:07:07,875
Cheers.

62
00:07:08,000 --> 00:07:09,000
Cheers.

63
00:07:15,833 --> 00:07:16,833
Then

64
00:07:17,166 --> 00:07:18,583
we'll leave this to Shen Zhiqin.

65
00:07:20,416 --> 00:07:21,208
Let me introduce,
Shen Zhiqin.

66
00:07:22,291 --> 00:07:24,750
Our top futures market trader.

67
00:07:26,166 --> 00:07:27,250
Leave Xiaoping to him.

68
00:07:27,291 --> 00:07:28,457
Give him firm instructions

69
00:07:28,458 --> 00:07:31,291
that he must train
Xiaoping to be an expert.

70
00:07:34,041 --> 00:07:35,875
Shen Zhiqin

71
00:07:36,023 --> 00:07:37,943
sounds like someone
who really gets things done.

72
00:07:39,125 --> 00:07:40,165
I'm just a regular nobody,

73
00:07:40,291 --> 00:07:41,611
so I have to work hard to get by.

74
00:07:43,250 --> 00:07:43,958
Oh, him.
He's always been like that.

75
00:07:44,958 --> 00:07:45,958
He's got personality,

76
00:07:46,041 --> 00:07:47,041
and I like that.

77
00:07:48,291 --> 00:07:49,291
Mr. Lu.

78
00:07:49,458 --> 00:07:50,833
Here's to you as well.

79
00:07:51,041 --> 00:07:52,541
Thank you for the job opportunity.

80
00:07:53,125 --> 00:07:53,875
Ziyang.

81
00:07:53,876 --> 00:07:55,041
We're both plainspoken,

82
00:07:55,166 --> 00:07:56,166
no games.

83
00:07:57,291 --> 00:07:58,083
As for me,

84
00:07:58,084 --> 00:07:59,416
I'm not sucking up to you,

85
00:07:59,500 --> 00:08:00,208
I'm only trying
to win over

86
00:08:01,167 --> 00:08:03,208
the powerful person backing you.

87
00:08:04,375 --> 00:08:06,041
We're partners here,

88
00:08:06,065 --> 00:08:07,315
nobody's sucking up to anybody.

89
00:08:07,492 --> 00:08:08,826
Lüqing'll show up soon.

90
00:08:10,708 --> 00:08:11,541
Mr. Lu.

91
00:08:11,708 --> 00:08:12,708
I'm full.

92
00:08:12,875 --> 00:08:14,435
If there's nothing else, I'll be going.

93
00:08:15,625 --> 00:08:16,625
What about Xiaoping?

94
00:08:16,833 --> 00:08:18,193
Be in the office by nine tomorrow.

95
00:08:18,416 --> 00:08:19,536
From now on, you're with me.

96
00:08:24,833 --> 00:08:25,833
No offense.

97
00:08:25,875 --> 00:08:27,416
He's just always been like this.

98
00:08:27,833 --> 00:08:29,707
Staring at charts all day fried his brain.

99
00:08:29,708 --> 00:08:30,708
Cheers.

100
00:08:35,125 --> 00:08:36,125
Still

101
00:08:36,375 --> 00:08:39,165
he's this cocky even with you, Mr. Lu.

102
00:08:39,166 --> 00:08:40,708
Well, he's genuinely talented.

103
00:08:41,083 --> 00:08:41,916
So what if he's arrogant?

104
00:08:41,917 --> 00:08:43,000
That won't do.

105
00:08:43,208 --> 00:08:44,041
Even talented as he is,

106
00:08:44,042 --> 00:08:45,665
he can't top you, Mr. Lu.

107
00:08:45,666 --> 00:08:47,208
You're far too lenient.

108
00:08:47,875 --> 00:08:49,208
Talent is what counts.

109
00:08:50,041 --> 00:08:52,000
What do social skills matter?

110
00:08:55,208 --> 00:08:55,625
Hey.

111
00:08:56,000 --> 00:08:56,791
Lüqing.

112
00:08:56,957 --> 00:08:58,457
Drink as forfeit! Drink!

113
00:09:01,875 --> 00:09:02,875
Lüqing.

114
00:09:03,583 --> 00:09:05,375
We haven't seen each other in years.

115
00:09:05,941 --> 00:09:07,501
Well, you've just been so busy, Mr. Lu.

116
00:09:08,083 --> 00:09:09,249
You flatter me.

117
00:09:09,250 --> 00:09:10,166
Ziyang knows

118
00:09:10,167 --> 00:09:11,458
how often I asked to meet,

119
00:09:11,708 --> 00:09:13,041
but you always blew me off.

120
00:09:13,666 --> 00:09:15,166
Here I am to take my forfeit!

121
00:09:21,875 --> 00:09:22,875
Lüqing.

122
00:09:23,184 --> 00:09:24,809
I wasn't blaming you.

123
00:09:24,833 --> 00:09:25,666
I've just

124
00:09:25,667 --> 00:09:26,915
got this bad habit.

125
00:09:26,916 --> 00:09:28,076
I always lay it on too thick.

126
00:09:28,666 --> 00:09:29,375
Xiaofan,

127
00:09:29,376 --> 00:09:31,833
I almost scared him
into closing his account.

128
00:09:32,166 --> 00:09:33,926
Mr. Lu, you don't put
on nearly enough airs.

129
00:09:34,208 --> 00:09:35,833
You're just scaring Xiaofan.

130
00:09:36,083 --> 00:09:36,791
Look at that.

131
00:09:36,792 --> 00:09:38,583
Just here and already on his side.

132
00:09:41,791 --> 00:09:42,583
Bro.

133
00:09:42,708 --> 00:09:43,750
What are you doing here?

134
00:09:44,333 --> 00:09:45,707
They all came for me.

135
00:09:45,708 --> 00:09:46,750
How could I not come?

136
00:09:47,416 --> 00:09:49,016
You're really making my brother do this?

137
00:09:49,291 --> 00:09:50,749
I don't wanna cause you trouble.

138
00:09:50,750 --> 00:09:51,750
It's fine.

139
00:09:54,375 --> 00:09:55,375
By the way.

140
00:09:55,666 --> 00:09:56,375
Next quarter,

141
00:09:56,376 --> 00:09:58,833
the CSRC may roll out new rules

142
00:09:59,666 --> 00:10:01,833
governing securities firm acquisitions.

143
00:10:04,833 --> 00:10:06,250
Isn't that just a matter of time?

144
00:10:07,250 --> 00:10:08,500
It's not if they regulate,

145
00:10:08,833 --> 00:10:10,125
but when.

146
00:10:11,833 --> 00:10:14,124
Whether the CSRC
regulates brokerages or not,

147
00:10:14,125 --> 00:10:15,958
it won’t stop you from profiting, Mr. Lu.

148
00:10:17,000 --> 00:10:18,583
I still need everyone's backing.

149
00:10:19,000 --> 00:10:20,583
Right? Come on, cheers.

150
00:10:20,916 --> 00:10:21,916
Cheers.

151
00:10:26,043 --> 00:10:27,496
[Textile Bureau]

152
00:10:36,458 --> 00:10:37,250
Bro.

153
00:10:37,291 --> 00:10:38,332
You head out first.

154
00:10:38,333 --> 00:10:40,165
Your car's too noticeable.

155
00:10:40,166 --> 00:10:41,166
Silly you.

156
00:10:43,833 --> 00:10:45,000
Good morning, Miss Xu.

157
00:10:45,375 --> 00:10:46,916
You're full of surprises, Fanfan.

158
00:10:47,041 --> 00:10:48,333
You even have a chauffeur car.

159
00:10:49,833 --> 00:10:51,000
And this is?

160
00:10:52,458 --> 00:10:53,500
This is my brother.

161
00:10:55,208 --> 00:10:56,248
Great to finally meet you.

162
00:10:56,375 --> 00:10:58,207
Fanfan's told me a lot about you.

163
00:10:58,208 --> 00:11:00,392
He said you're a communications officer
at the Textile Administration Bureau,

164
00:11:00,416 --> 00:11:01,736
good with both words and writing.

165
00:11:01,875 --> 00:11:02,666
Quite the wordsmith.
Impressive.

166
00:11:05,500 --> 00:11:06,500
He's my brother-in-law.

167
00:11:10,583 --> 00:11:12,040
I know everything about Fanfan.

168
00:11:12,041 --> 00:11:13,481
Just waiting for the divorce, right?

169
00:11:15,208 --> 00:11:16,208
Bro.

170
00:11:16,416 --> 00:11:18,125
I've got a schedule to grab this morning.

171
00:11:18,208 --> 00:11:19,208
I'll get going.

172
00:11:19,333 --> 00:11:20,333
Let's go, Miss Xu.

173
00:11:43,250 --> 00:11:45,125
I'd like fish congee tomorrow morning.

174
00:11:45,500 --> 00:11:46,291
Bro.

175
00:11:46,458 --> 00:11:47,499
Can we get congee like this

176
00:11:47,500 --> 00:11:48,583
over the weekend?

177
00:11:48,750 --> 00:11:49,500
I've been

178
00:11:49,501 --> 00:11:50,625
on morning shifts lately.

179
00:11:51,333 --> 00:11:51,958
Actually,

180
00:11:51,959 --> 00:11:53,166
you don't need to come.

181
00:11:56,625 --> 00:11:58,290
Then I'll make congee every morning

182
00:11:58,291 --> 00:11:59,166
and bring it over to you.
Whatever.

183
00:12:13,666 --> 00:12:14,500
Bro.

184
00:12:14,666 --> 00:12:15,707
If there's nothing else,

185
00:12:15,708 --> 00:12:16,833
I'll be going then.

186
00:12:25,458 --> 00:12:26,208
Bro,
anything

187
00:12:27,333 --> 00:12:28,541
you need me to pick up?

188
00:12:30,666 --> 00:12:31,666
Getting your things?

189
00:12:34,083 --> 00:12:35,403
Want me to get a key cut for you?

190
00:12:39,833 --> 00:12:41,583
You gonna give me a key?

191
00:12:43,666 --> 00:12:44,666
Bro.

192
00:12:44,708 --> 00:12:45,791
There's really no need.

193
00:12:45,875 --> 00:12:46,999
I'll come whenever you call.

194
00:12:47,000 --> 00:12:48,000
No need to give me a key.
Lu Xiaofan.

195
00:12:49,791 --> 00:12:50,915
Don't think

196
00:12:50,916 --> 00:12:52,250
you're all that important.

197
00:12:55,750 --> 00:12:56,166
Well then.

198
00:12:56,666 --> 00:12:58,833
I'll cook congee tomorrow
morning and bring it over.

199
00:12:59,208 --> 00:13:00,750
If you leave today,

200
00:13:01,500 --> 00:13:03,500
don't come looking for me tomorrow.

201
00:13:14,083 --> 00:13:15,083
Then I'll

202
00:13:15,708 --> 00:13:16,958
move in this weekend.

203
00:13:18,333 --> 00:13:19,333
Wait.

204
00:13:31,625 --> 00:13:32,416
Bro.
This.

205
00:13:33,042 --> 00:13:35,041
If you toss this in the trash again,

206
00:13:36,208 --> 00:13:37,708
I'll toss you right in with it.

207
00:14:17,416 --> 00:14:18,125
Fanfan.

208
00:14:18,126 --> 00:14:19,708
Are you moving out for good?

209
00:14:23,291 --> 00:14:24,833
It'll be easier living over there.

210
00:14:25,083 --> 00:14:26,333
This place is tiny.

211
00:14:26,666 --> 00:14:28,833
That'll make things roomier for you two.

212
00:14:29,291 --> 00:14:30,791
Tell Lüqing thanks for me.

213
00:14:32,708 --> 00:14:34,624
You be good once you get there.

214
00:14:34,625 --> 00:14:36,000
Don't trouble Lüqing.

215
00:14:37,541 --> 00:14:37,958
Okay.

216
00:14:38,291 --> 00:14:39,333
Lüqing loves congee.

217
00:14:39,458 --> 00:14:40,416
Can you pull off making congee?

218
00:14:40,417 --> 00:14:42,297
Maybe I should head over
and make some for him.

219
00:14:43,500 --> 00:14:44,541
No need, Mom.

220
00:14:45,375 --> 00:14:46,707
This congee's tricky.

221
00:14:46,708 --> 00:14:47,833
You don't know the trick.

222
00:14:49,583 --> 00:14:51,000
You know, that boy Lüqing

223
00:14:51,375 --> 00:14:52,832
never shamed our family,

224
00:14:52,833 --> 00:14:53,999
always helped us out.

225
00:14:54,000 --> 00:14:54,583
Really...
Mom.

226
00:14:56,416 --> 00:14:57,496
Heat the food up, will you?

227
00:14:58,958 --> 00:14:59,666
Eat, eat.
Food's all you think about.

228
00:15:00,666 --> 00:15:02,207
Your brother rarely gets to come home.

229
00:15:02,208 --> 00:15:03,767
Isn't talking more important than eating?

230
00:15:03,791 --> 00:15:06,125
Heat it up and we'll all eat together.

231
00:15:08,458 --> 00:15:09,125
Fanfan.

232
00:15:09,126 --> 00:15:10,486
Finish your meal before you leave.

233
00:15:17,458 --> 00:15:18,458
Xiaofan.

234
00:15:18,500 --> 00:15:20,124
You know, after dinner that day,

235
00:15:20,125 --> 00:15:21,416
Lüqing opened an account.

236
00:15:23,375 --> 00:15:24,541
I'm staying out of this.

237
00:15:25,041 --> 00:15:26,833
You know how big that trade was?

238
00:15:27,250 --> 00:15:29,124
1.6 million.

239
00:15:29,125 --> 00:15:30,125
Xiaofan.

240
00:15:31,000 --> 00:15:32,832
My pay's just over two thousand monthly.

241
00:15:32,833 --> 00:15:34,153
Just twenty-five thousand a year.

242
00:15:36,643 --> 00:15:38,309
I'd have to work my fingers to the bone

243
00:15:38,333 --> 00:15:39,999
for seventy years to
make that kind of money.

244
00:15:40,000 --> 00:15:41,500
He gets it in a blink.

245
00:15:43,208 --> 00:15:44,666
How’d you find out?

246
00:15:45,791 --> 00:15:47,791
Shen Zhiqin handles all his trades.

247
00:15:48,000 --> 00:15:49,000
Right.

248
00:15:49,375 --> 00:15:51,583
I snuck a peek while
he was in the bathroom.

249
00:15:52,083 --> 00:15:53,833
Why spy on his account?

250
00:15:54,125 --> 00:15:55,207
What's wrong with looking?

251
00:15:55,208 --> 00:15:56,290
The way you talk about the Beis,

252
00:15:56,291 --> 00:15:57,624
you make them sound all pure
and innocent, yet so deceptive.

253
00:15:57,625 --> 00:15:58,541
Turns out

254
00:15:58,625 --> 00:16:00,041
they just won't cut us in.

255
00:16:00,458 --> 00:16:01,458
Lu Xiaoping.

256
00:16:01,666 --> 00:16:03,000
Can you cut me some slack?

257
00:16:08,000 --> 00:16:09,000
Pingping.

258
00:16:09,791 --> 00:16:11,125
Fanfan, let's eat first.

259
00:16:11,541 --> 00:16:12,333
No, thanks.

260
00:16:12,500 --> 00:16:13,900
Lüqing's waiting for me downstairs.

261
00:16:15,333 --> 00:16:16,333
Fanfan.

262
00:16:16,708 --> 00:16:17,708
Fanfan.

263
00:16:20,750 --> 00:16:21,750
Fanfan.

264
00:16:23,291 --> 00:16:24,125
I know
your brother

265
00:16:25,001 --> 00:16:26,583
is a total lost cause.

266
00:16:27,166 --> 00:16:29,000
But no matter what, he's still family.

267
00:16:29,250 --> 00:16:30,250
Mom.

268
00:16:30,708 --> 00:16:32,000
I can't make the call on this.

269
00:16:33,916 --> 00:16:34,666
Fanfan.

270
00:16:34,667 --> 00:16:35,747
Take good care of yourself.

271
00:16:55,291 --> 00:16:56,375
How's Aunt Lu doing?

272
00:16:58,416 --> 00:16:59,416
She's doing well.

273
00:17:01,291 --> 00:17:02,731
She's been thinking about you a lot.

274
00:17:03,500 --> 00:17:04,500
She even said

275
00:17:04,666 --> 00:17:06,125
she'd make congee for you herself,

276
00:17:06,375 --> 00:17:07,735
and claims mine isn't good enough.

277
00:17:10,500 --> 00:17:12,082
When should we bring Aunt Lu out?

278
00:17:12,083 --> 00:17:13,403
I'll take her around to sightsee.

279
00:17:16,416 --> 00:17:17,458
Ever since she got here,

280
00:17:18,208 --> 00:17:20,708
I am guessing your brother
has given her zero peace.

281
00:17:50,416 --> 00:17:52,375
Watching the market, Mr. Shen?

282
00:17:58,166 --> 00:17:59,506
[Corn futures]

283
00:18:05,000 --> 00:18:06,583
I've never seen anything like this.

284
00:18:07,000 --> 00:18:07,916
This little brother of mine,

285
00:18:07,917 --> 00:18:09,708
no wonder so many people fawn over him.

286
00:18:09,916 --> 00:18:11,166
Now I get it.

287
00:18:15,375 --> 00:18:16,166
Good work, everyone.

288
00:18:16,208 --> 00:18:17,375
You all did great today.

289
00:18:17,708 --> 00:18:19,208
Don't just stare at screens all day.

290
00:18:19,291 --> 00:18:21,333
Roam VIP trading rooms for market chatter.

291
00:18:26,666 --> 00:18:28,466
Who knows who'll be
whose boss down the line.

292
00:18:52,250 --> 00:18:53,333
Why is it you again?

293
00:18:53,916 --> 00:18:54,916
Got a problem?

294
00:18:57,666 --> 00:18:58,666
Where's Li Wenxi?

295
00:18:59,625 --> 00:19:00,625
We broke up.

296
00:19:03,000 --> 00:19:04,000
Broke up?

297
00:19:04,125 --> 00:19:06,445
Haven't you noticed I haven't
been wearing my ring lately?

298
00:19:07,458 --> 00:19:08,916
I didn't want to overthink it.

299
00:19:09,625 --> 00:19:10,041
Hey.

300
00:19:10,500 --> 00:19:11,500
Bei Lüqing.

301
00:19:12,375 --> 00:19:13,375
You still there?

302
00:19:13,833 --> 00:19:15,000
Let's talk business.

303
00:19:15,625 --> 00:19:19,573
No wonder he turned me down flat when I reached
out to Li Wenxi about a deal the other day.

304
00:19:19,958 --> 00:19:20,958
How about

305
00:19:21,041 --> 00:19:22,541
I put you two in touch

306
00:19:22,666 --> 00:19:23,832
so you can meet?

307
00:19:23,833 --> 00:19:24,375
Enough.

308
00:19:24,376 --> 00:19:25,833
You should get to the point.

309
00:19:26,375 --> 00:19:28,833
Great if Li Wenxi partners with us.

310
00:19:29,125 --> 00:19:30,207
But if he won't,

311
00:19:30,208 --> 00:19:31,582
there's no need to push it.

312
00:19:31,583 --> 00:19:32,583
Right?

313
00:19:33,416 --> 00:19:34,625
We don't need him,

314
00:19:34,833 --> 00:19:36,250
but if he sets out to sabotage us,

315
00:19:36,583 --> 00:19:37,791
it'll be a huge hassle.

316
00:19:38,666 --> 00:19:40,333
You think I'm scared of his sabotage?

317
00:19:40,791 --> 00:19:41,791
Exactly.

318
00:19:41,833 --> 00:19:42,833
Don't forget.

319
00:19:43,166 --> 00:19:44,499
Powerful as the Lis are,

320
00:19:44,500 --> 00:19:45,916
they only hold sway in Gangcheng.

321
00:19:46,583 --> 00:19:47,915
This is our home turf.

322
00:19:47,916 --> 00:19:48,916
Here,

323
00:19:49,041 --> 00:19:50,666
he plays by our rules.

324
00:19:52,083 --> 00:19:53,083
Still,

325
00:19:53,208 --> 00:19:54,750
Li Wenxi has deep pockets

326
00:19:55,166 --> 00:19:56,333
and family backing.

327
00:19:56,833 --> 00:19:58,208
If he dumps heavy positions,

328
00:19:58,250 --> 00:19:59,791
we may not be able to match him.

329
00:20:00,375 --> 00:20:01,415
China's stock market

330
00:20:01,416 --> 00:20:02,458
is in free fall.

331
00:20:02,791 --> 00:20:05,208
It crashed from above
1000 to barely 300 points.

332
00:20:05,500 --> 00:20:07,000
It's a sheer vertical plunge,

333
00:20:07,208 --> 00:20:08,291
no rebound whatsoever.

334
00:20:08,583 --> 00:20:10,000
Most of the trends...

335
00:20:10,833 --> 00:20:12,250
This is our first battle.

336
00:20:12,500 --> 00:20:13,833
The old men are all watching.

337
00:20:14,375 --> 00:20:15,833
We set the policies.

338
00:20:15,916 --> 00:20:17,541
We built the market.

339
00:20:17,666 --> 00:20:18,874
If this were Gangcheng.

340
00:20:18,875 --> 00:20:20,166
I couldn't promise a thing.

341
00:20:20,250 --> 00:20:21,250
But here...

342
00:20:21,500 --> 00:20:23,625
Does Li Wenxi know how to play this game?

343
00:20:23,833 --> 00:20:25,166
Out-of-town rube.

344
00:20:48,000 --> 00:20:49,208
How do you like this place?

345
00:20:55,875 --> 00:20:57,625
It's... it's nice.

346
00:20:59,464 --> 00:21:01,589
I'll get transferred to
Austria for work next year.

347
00:21:02,000 --> 00:21:03,625
I'll settle there then.

348
00:21:04,416 --> 00:21:05,500
You'll come with me.

349
00:21:09,166 --> 00:21:09,833
Bei Lüqing.

350
00:21:09,834 --> 00:21:11,166
Can you be serious for once?

351
00:21:15,000 --> 00:21:16,833
Don't worry about the funding.

352
00:21:17,000 --> 00:21:19,708
The funds hit your account
first thing tomorrow.

353
00:21:20,666 --> 00:21:21,986
Our accounts need to be separate.

354
00:21:22,625 --> 00:21:24,250
No obvious ties on paper.

355
00:21:25,916 --> 00:21:27,375
I've handled all of this.

356
00:21:28,976 --> 00:21:29,934
No one beats Master Bei.

357
00:21:29,958 --> 00:21:30,958
Solid.

358
00:21:49,625 --> 00:21:50,625
Sell it all.

359
00:21:53,166 --> 00:21:54,708
Wh... what?

360
00:21:56,250 --> 00:21:57,416
Do you trade stocks?

361
00:21:59,083 --> 00:22:00,166
Sell tomorrow.

362
00:22:00,375 --> 00:22:01,791
You're not cut out for finance.

363
00:22:03,666 --> 00:22:04,958
You've only got a little money.

364
00:22:05,333 --> 00:22:06,208
Once you get your paycheck,

365
00:22:06,209 --> 00:22:08,041
stick it in a bank deposit.

366
00:22:11,208 --> 00:22:12,408
This is my supplementary card.

367
00:22:13,833 --> 00:22:15,000
Anytime you need it,

368
00:22:15,166 --> 00:22:16,375
no need to check in with me.

369
00:22:18,666 --> 00:22:19,666
Bro.

370
00:22:20,750 --> 00:22:21,750
Aren't you...

371
00:22:22,250 --> 00:22:24,041
Aren't you scared I'll spend you broke?

372
00:22:30,583 --> 00:22:31,750
You're mine.

373
00:22:32,208 --> 00:22:34,000
Everything you buy is mine too.

374
00:22:34,500 --> 00:22:35,820
How could I possibly go bankrupt?

375
00:22:37,791 --> 00:22:38,791
Bro...

376
00:22:39,625 --> 00:22:40,916
I haven't showered yet, Bro.

377
00:22:41,166 --> 00:22:42,458
You dare provoke me?

378
00:22:43,208 --> 00:22:44,625
You'll pay the price.

379
00:22:48,000 --> 00:22:49,000
I...

380
00:22:49,125 --> 00:22:50,500
I haven't finished the apple.

381
00:22:53,583 --> 00:22:54,833
You ate the top part.

382
00:22:55,583 --> 00:22:56,958
Haven't touched the bottom yet.

383
00:22:57,208 --> 00:22:58,833
Through thick and thin, right?

384
00:23:00,083 --> 00:23:01,083
Bro!

385
00:23:04,958 --> 00:23:06,291
It's me, Fanfan. Bro!

386
00:23:06,875 --> 00:23:07,875
Someone's here.

387
00:23:08,208 --> 00:23:09,408
- Someone's really here.
- Fanfan.

388
00:23:10,791 --> 00:23:11,791
Fanfan.

389
00:23:13,041 --> 00:23:14,458
It's me, Fanfan!

390
00:23:16,750 --> 00:23:17,750
Brother!

391
00:23:18,666 --> 00:23:19,666
What are you doing here?

392
00:23:24,041 --> 00:23:25,041
Already ate.

393
00:23:28,451 --> 00:23:29,451
Take this.

394
00:23:29,833 --> 00:23:31,041
You can't read the room.

395
00:23:32,041 --> 00:23:33,207
What did you buy this for?

396
00:23:33,208 --> 00:23:34,708
Come on, don't say that.

397
00:23:34,791 --> 00:23:35,832
I came to thank Lüqing

398
00:23:35,833 --> 00:23:36,833
for getting me a job.

399
00:23:36,834 --> 00:23:37,874
Would I come empty-handed?

400
00:23:38,000 --> 00:23:39,500
You have no social savvy at all.

401
00:23:42,083 --> 00:23:43,500
Just look at this decor.

402
00:23:43,666 --> 00:23:44,666
Really nice.

403
00:23:45,416 --> 00:23:47,500
It has such a relaxing vibe.

404
00:23:50,166 --> 00:23:51,541
What style is this again?

405
00:23:52,333 --> 00:23:53,333
Mediterranean.

406
00:23:55,958 --> 00:23:56,375
Hey.
- Lüqing
- Bro.

407
00:23:57,833 --> 00:23:58,833
Have you eaten?

408
00:24:02,083 --> 00:24:03,958
Didn't Xiaofan just tell you?

409
00:24:05,041 --> 00:24:06,041
Lüqing.

410
00:24:06,291 --> 00:24:09,333
I came here to thank you.

411
00:24:10,125 --> 00:24:11,125
No need.

412
00:24:12,291 --> 00:24:13,625
Just thank your brother.

413
00:24:15,000 --> 00:24:16,000
Yes, of course.

414
00:24:16,500 --> 00:24:17,958
At the end of the day,

415
00:24:18,000 --> 00:24:19,707
I know Lüqing only helped me

416
00:24:19,708 --> 00:24:20,832
because of our family ties.

417
00:24:20,833 --> 00:24:21,500
Otherwise,

418
00:24:21,666 --> 00:24:24,250
someone of your stature

419
00:24:24,583 --> 00:24:25,500
would never bother

420
00:24:25,501 --> 00:24:26,861
with the affairs of folks like us.

421
00:24:29,625 --> 00:24:30,874
Cut some fruit for Lüqing.

422
00:24:30,875 --> 00:24:32,075
What are you sitting here for?

423
00:24:33,125 --> 00:24:33,916
No need.

424
00:24:34,083 --> 00:24:35,208
We just had some.

425
00:24:36,250 --> 00:24:38,332
Actually, I've wanted to visit ages ago.

426
00:24:38,333 --> 00:24:39,333
But,

427
00:24:40,333 --> 00:24:41,333
well, I

428
00:24:41,375 --> 00:24:43,583
I haven't achieved much at work yet.

429
00:24:44,000 --> 00:24:45,000
I was scared

430
00:24:45,375 --> 00:24:46,708
I'd embarrass you, so...

431
00:24:47,500 --> 00:24:48,625
I was too ashamed to visit.

432
00:24:49,791 --> 00:24:50,791
Lüqing.

433
00:24:51,875 --> 00:24:53,625
You're a wise man,

434
00:24:54,250 --> 00:24:56,833
so I'll be straight with you.

435
00:24:59,500 --> 00:25:02,208
I know you're a major client at Langjian.

436
00:25:03,125 --> 00:25:04,125
I just wanted to ask...

437
00:25:05,000 --> 00:25:06,000
could you

438
00:25:06,708 --> 00:25:08,333
let me be your trader?

439
00:25:08,500 --> 00:25:09,500
Brother!

440
00:25:09,666 --> 00:25:10,915
Shen Zhiqin is Langjian's

441
00:25:10,916 --> 00:25:12,333
top trader.

442
00:25:13,041 --> 00:25:13,875
You're new there,

443
00:25:13,876 --> 00:25:14,999
don't even try to compete.

444
00:25:15,000 --> 00:25:16,832
We're family, so let's
skip the formalities.

445
00:25:16,856 --> 00:25:18,356
I'm new there, that's true.

446
00:25:18,583 --> 00:25:19,583
But is Shen Zhiqin

447
00:25:19,584 --> 00:25:20,999
as trustworthy as one of our own?

448
00:25:21,000 --> 00:25:21,875
Who knows

449
00:25:21,876 --> 00:25:22,999
what shady tricks he's hiding?

450
00:25:23,000 --> 00:25:23,666
Right?
This is non-negotiable.

451
00:25:25,083 --> 00:25:25,875
Brother.
Can't you

452
00:25:26,584 --> 00:25:28,666
just mind your own work?

453
00:25:28,958 --> 00:25:29,958
Xiaofan.

454
00:25:30,333 --> 00:25:32,333
Don't butt in while adults talk.

455
00:25:34,500 --> 00:25:35,749
All I want is to loyally

456
00:25:35,750 --> 00:25:37,166
work for our own people.

457
00:25:37,416 --> 00:25:38,500
Let me put it this way.

458
00:25:38,708 --> 00:25:39,976
Is Shen Zhiqin really that trustworthy?

459
00:25:40,000 --> 00:25:41,040
The faultless ones

460
00:25:41,041 --> 00:25:42,500
always have deep flaws.

461
00:25:42,875 --> 00:25:44,666
Shen Zhiqin stares at quotes all day,

462
00:25:44,714 --> 00:25:46,339
barely speaks a word to others.

463
00:25:46,416 --> 00:25:47,291
Don't you think
a trader like that

464
00:25:48,042 --> 00:25:49,333
is a little too perfect?

465
00:25:53,375 --> 00:25:54,375
Fine.

466
00:25:56,666 --> 00:25:57,500
Bro!
He doesn't know anything!

467
00:25:58,459 --> 00:25:59,708
What do I need to know?

468
00:26:02,333 --> 00:26:04,166
I follow Lüqing's every order.

469
00:26:04,916 --> 00:26:05,583
Besides,

470
00:26:05,584 --> 00:26:07,290
Lüqing's loaded with insider info.

471
00:26:07,291 --> 00:26:08,416
How could I lose?

472
00:26:08,791 --> 00:26:09,791
Alright.

473
00:26:10,250 --> 00:26:11,250
I've got to go.

474
00:26:11,916 --> 00:26:13,500
You two brothers can catch up.

475
00:26:19,083 --> 00:26:20,483
Brother Bei, don't let us keep you.

476
00:26:28,041 --> 00:26:29,207
Look at you, tagging along after him

477
00:26:29,208 --> 00:26:30,208
every single day.

478
00:26:30,625 --> 00:26:32,083
You cook and brew tea,

479
00:26:32,375 --> 00:26:33,874
acting like a servant.

480
00:26:33,875 --> 00:26:35,115
What have you gotten out of it?

481
00:26:35,875 --> 00:26:36,875
Alright.

482
00:26:37,000 --> 00:26:38,333
I know your true colors.

483
00:26:39,541 --> 00:26:40,541
Don't worry.

484
00:26:41,000 --> 00:26:41,916
Once I reap the benefits,

485
00:26:41,917 --> 00:26:43,791
I won't forget you.

486
00:26:46,375 --> 00:26:47,375
I'm tired today.

487
00:26:47,500 --> 00:26:48,500
I'm heading home.

488
00:26:48,708 --> 00:26:50,333
Think carefully about what I said.

489
00:26:58,666 --> 00:26:59,458
Bro.

490
00:26:59,666 --> 00:27:01,250
Where did you go last night?

491
00:27:01,672 --> 00:27:03,131
I didn't realize you were back.

492
00:27:04,125 --> 00:27:05,375
Do I have to

493
00:27:05,833 --> 00:27:07,193
report everything I do to you now?

494
00:27:08,666 --> 00:27:09,916
That's not what I meant.

495
00:27:12,208 --> 00:27:13,208
Come eat.

496
00:27:14,583 --> 00:27:15,583
Mm.

497
00:27:26,500 --> 00:27:27,500
Bro.

498
00:27:27,833 --> 00:27:29,625
Don't bother with Lu Xiaoping.

499
00:27:30,083 --> 00:27:31,500
Whatever he tells you,

500
00:27:31,708 --> 00:27:33,000
don't agree.

501
00:27:34,791 --> 00:27:36,191
Wouldn't that just be more trouble?

502
00:27:37,166 --> 00:27:38,333
You Lus never quit

503
00:27:38,500 --> 00:27:40,833
till you get what you want.

504
00:27:42,083 --> 00:27:43,625
If he wants to do it, let him.

505
00:28:00,333 --> 00:28:01,958
Why find me at work?

506
00:28:02,875 --> 00:28:04,000
Did you mess something up?

507
00:28:05,000 --> 00:28:06,250
Wish me luck for once, can you?

508
00:28:07,208 --> 00:28:08,208
There's really nothing?

509
00:28:09,375 --> 00:28:10,832
I got my first paycheck today.

510
00:28:10,833 --> 00:28:11,833
Guess how much?

511
00:28:11,875 --> 00:28:12,875
Over ten thousand.

512
00:28:14,250 --> 00:28:15,610
Then knuckle down and do the work.

513
00:28:15,791 --> 00:28:16,791
Stay grounded.

514
00:28:17,291 --> 00:28:18,708
Who's the older brother?

515
00:28:20,125 --> 00:28:21,207
If there's nothing else,

516
00:28:21,208 --> 00:28:22,208
I'm going back to work.

517
00:28:23,666 --> 00:28:24,666
This guy...

518
00:28:26,500 --> 00:28:27,660
Actually, there is something.

519
00:28:29,583 --> 00:28:30,583
What do you want?

520
00:28:31,333 --> 00:28:32,874
The Agriculture Ministry will put out

521
00:28:32,875 --> 00:28:34,555
a major announcement in the coming months.

522
00:28:34,666 --> 00:28:35,541
Classified.
Bei Lüqing

523
00:28:36,208 --> 00:28:36,958
and the others must have known

524
00:28:36,959 --> 00:28:38,166
what this news is all along.

525
00:28:38,416 --> 00:28:40,136
Lu Tao's been sticking right on their heels

526
00:28:40,833 --> 00:28:42,593
and he's just trying
to ride their coattails.

527
00:28:43,375 --> 00:28:45,250
Watch the market closely for brother.

528
00:28:45,708 --> 00:28:46,788
Don't worry about the rest.

529
00:28:47,125 --> 00:28:49,332
Everyone wants in on this big windfall.

530
00:28:49,333 --> 00:28:50,583
Can't you listen out more?

531
00:28:51,833 --> 00:28:52,666
You don't wanna get in on this?

532
00:28:52,667 --> 00:28:53,833
I sure do.

533
00:28:55,291 --> 00:28:56,999
300k minimum to open an account.

534
00:28:57,000 --> 00:28:58,520
Where're you gonna get that much cash?

535
00:28:58,666 --> 00:29:00,000
Why overthink it?

536
00:29:02,416 --> 00:29:03,583
You're such a blockhead.

537
00:29:04,583 --> 00:29:05,663
I can't get through to you.

538
00:29:16,666 --> 00:29:17,666
What's wrong?

539
00:29:17,833 --> 00:29:18,833
Is something the matter?

540
00:29:22,333 --> 00:29:23,458
Well, actually...

541
00:29:23,666 --> 00:29:25,541
It's nothing, really.

542
00:29:29,208 --> 00:29:31,041
I know whether something's wrong with you.

543
00:29:33,833 --> 00:29:36,337
Is my brother OK?
With handling things?

544
00:29:37,708 --> 00:29:38,708
His business

545
00:29:39,000 --> 00:29:40,000
isn't your concern.

546
00:29:40,791 --> 00:29:43,166
I'm just afraid he'll cause you trouble.

547
00:29:43,708 --> 00:29:45,666
I don't mind him bringing me trouble.

548
00:29:53,625 --> 00:29:54,541
Is your brother in?
Mm.

549
00:29:58,333 --> 00:29:59,333
Eating so early?

550
00:29:59,708 --> 00:30:00,976
Got something to deal with later.

551
00:30:01,000 --> 00:30:02,000
What's up?

552
00:30:02,125 --> 00:30:03,832
Young Master Lin never

553
00:30:03,833 --> 00:30:05,166
drops by without cause.

554
00:30:05,666 --> 00:30:06,500
Alright, alright.
Shouldn't have messed with you.

555
00:30:07,501 --> 00:30:08,581
Let's get down to business.
